 and refreshes all enemy actions\n- `start_turn()`: first enemy does turn\n- `_on_enemy_action_completed()`: chains to next enemy or emits `enemy_turn_ended`\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/battle/battle.gd`** (48 lines)\n- `Battle extends Node2D`\n- Creates character stats instance, connects events (turn management, player death, battle over)\n- `start_battle()`: unpauses, plays music, resets enemies, starts player handler\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.gd`** (78 lines)\n- Draws arc Line2D from card to mouse using 8 points with eased curve\n- `_process()`: updates Area2D to mouse, redraws arc\n- `_on_card_aim_started()`: only for single-target cards; enables targeting\n- `_on_card_aim_ended()`: clears targeting state\n- Area2D enter/exit: adds/removes areas from `current_card.targets`\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/battle_ui.gd`** (28 lines)\n- `BattleUI extends CanvasLayer`\n- Connects `player_hand_drawn` -> enables end turn button\n- End turn button -> emits `player_turn_ended`\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.gd`** (22 lines)\n- `BattleOverPanel extends Panel`\n- `show_screen()`: sets text, shows win/lose buttons, pauses game\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/mana_ui.gd`** (22 lines)\n- `ManaUI extends Panel`\n- Displays `mana/max_mana` text\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/intent_ui.gd`** (18 lines)\n- `IntentUI extends HBoxContainer`\n- `update_intent()`: updates icon + number or hides\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/stats_ui.gd`** (15 lines)\n- `StatsUI extends HBoxContainer`\n- `update_stats()`: shows block (if >0) and health (if >0)\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/red_flash.gd`** (18 lines)\n- `RedFlash extends CanvasLayer`\n- On `player_hit`: sets alpha to 0.2, starts timer; on timeout: alpha back to 0\n\n**`/workspace/scenes/ui/tooltip.gd`** (44 lines)\n- `Tooltip extends PanelContainer`\n- Fade-in/fade-out tooltip with tween animation\n- Subscribes to `card_tooltip_requested` and `tooltip_hide_requested`\n\n---\n\n#### 3c. Custom Resources\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/stats.gd`** (40 lines)\n- `Stats extends Resource`\n- Signal `stats_changed`\n- Exports: `max_health`, `art: Texture`\n- Properties: `health` (clamped 0..max_health), `block` (clamped 0..999)\n- `take_damage()`: block mitigates damage, then reduces health\n- `heal()`, `create_instance()`: duplicates resource with fresh health/block\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/character_stats.gd`** (42 lines)\n- `CharacterStats extends Stats`\n- Exports: `starting_deck`, `cards_per_turn`, `max_mana`\n- Properties: `mana`, `deck`, `discard`, `draw_pile`\n- `reset_mana()`, `take_damage()` (emits `player_hit`), `can_play_card()`\n- `create_instance()`: duplicates, resets health/block/mana, creates draw/discard piles\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/enemy_stats.gd`** (4 lines)\n- `EnemyStats extends Stats`\n- Export: `ai: PackedScene`\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/card.gd`** (52 lines)\n- `Card extends Resource`\n- Enums: `Type {ATTACK, SKILL, POWER}`, `Target {SELF, SINGLE_ENEMY, ALL_ENEMIES, EVERYONE}`\n- Exports: `id`, `type`, `target`, `cost`, `icon`, `tooltip_text`, `sound`\n- `play()`: emits `card_played`, deducts mana, applies effects to resolved targets\n- `apply_effects()`: pass (override in card scripts)\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/card_pile.gd`** (37 lines)\n- `CardPile extends Resource`\n- Signal `card_pile_size_changed`\n- Methods: `empty()`, `draw_card()` (pop front), `add_card()` (append), `shuffle()`, `clear()`\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/effect.gd`** (8 lines)\n- `Effect extends RefCounted`\n- Variable `sound: AudioStream`\n- `execute()`: pass (override)\n\n**`/workspace/custom_resources/intent.gd`** (5 lines)\n- `Intent extends Resource`\n- Exports: `number: String`, `icon: Texture`\n\n---\n\n#### 3d. Global / Autoload Scripts\n\n**`/workspace/global/events.gd`** (24 lines)\n- `Events extends Node` -- event bus singleton\n- Card signals: `card_drag_started/ended`, `card_aim_started/ended`, `card_played`, `card_tooltip_requested`, `tooltip_hide_requested`\n- Player signals: `player_hand_drawn/discarded`, `player_turn_ended`, `player_hit`, `player_died`\n- Enemy signals: `enemy_action_completed`, `enemy_turn_ended`\n- Battle: `battle_over_screen_requested(text, type)`\n\n**`/workspace/global/shaker.gd`** (20 lines)\n- `Shaker extends Node`\n- `shake()`: 10-step tween-based positional shake with decaying strength\n\n**`/workspace/global/sound_player.gd`** (20 lines)\n- `SoundPlayer extends Node`\n- `play(audio, single=false)`: finds first idle child AudioStreamPlayer and plays; if single=true, stops all first\n- `stop()`: stops all children\n\n---\n\n#### 3e. Effects\n\n**`/workspace/effects/damage_effect.gd`** (13 lines)\n- `DamageEffect extends Effect`\n- `amount := 0`\n- `execute()`: calls `target.take_damage(amount)` for each Enemy/Player target, plays SFX\n\n**`/workspace/effects/block_effect.gd`** (13 lines)\n- `BlockEffect extends Effect`\n- `amount := 0`\n- `execute()`: adds amount to `target.stats.block`, plays SFX\n\n---\n\n#### 3f. Character Cards\n\n**`/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_axe_attack.gd`** (8 lines)\n- `extends Card`, `apply_effects()`: creates DamageEffect(amount=6), executes\n\n**`/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_slash.gd`** (8 lines)\n- `extends Card`, `apply_effects()`: creates DamageEffect(amount=4), executes\n\n**`/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_block.gd`** (8 lines)\n- `extends Card`, `apply_effects()`: creates BlockEffect(amount=5), executes\n\n---\n\n#### 3g. Enemy Actions\n\n**`/workspace/enemies/bat/bat_attack_action.gd`** (28 lines)\n- `extends EnemyAction`, `damage := 4`\n- `perform_action()`: Tween animation (move to target, hit twice with 35ms gap, return), emits `enemy_action_completed`\n\n**`/workspace/enemies/bat/bat_block_action.gd`** (19 lines)\n- `extends EnemyAction`, `block := 4`\n- `perform_action()`: applies BlockEffect to self, delays 0.6s, emits `enemy_action_completed`\n\n**`/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_attack_action.gd`** (26 lines)\n- `extends EnemyAction`, `damage := 7`\n- Similar to bat attack but single hit with 25ms gap\n\n**`/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_block_action.gd`** (18 lines)\n- `extends EnemyAction`, `block := 6`\n- Same pattern as bat block\n\n**`/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_mega_block_action.gd`** (31 lines)\n- `extends EnemyAction`, `block := 15`, `hp_threshold := 6`, `already_used := false`\n- `is_performable()`: CONDITIONAL -- returns true only if health <= hp_threshold (only first time)\n- `perform_action()`: applies massive block\n\n---\n\n#### 3h. Script Templates\n\n**`/workspace/script_templates/Node/card_template.gd`** (10 lines)\n- Meta: \"Card Logic\". `extends Card`, has optional_sound export, prints debug in `apply_effects()`\n\n**`/workspace/script_templates/Node/effect_template.gd`** (11 lines)\n- Meta: \"Effect\". `extends Effect`, has member_var, prints debug in `execute()`\n\n**`/workspace/script_templates/Node/enemy_action_template.gd`** (16 lines)\n- Meta: \"EnemyAction\". `extends EnemyAction`, has tween template for movement + play sound + emit completed\n\n---\n\n### 4. State Machine Related Files\n\nThe project has a card dragging state machine system implemented with these files:\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_state_machine.gd` | **State Machine controller** -- `init()` maps children by their `state` enum value, stubs for forwarding input/enter/exit (all empty) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd` | **Base state class** -- defines `State` enum (`BASE=0, CLICKED=1, DRAGGING=2, RELEASED=3`), `transition_requested` signal, inherited `enter/exit/on_input/on_gui_input/on_mouse_entered/on_mouse_exited` stubs |\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_base_state.gd` | Base/Idle state (empty, only extends) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_clicked_state.gd` | Clicked state (empty, only extends) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd` | Dragging state -- declares `DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD = 0.06` (otherwise empty) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd` | Released state (empty, only extends) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd` | **Fully implemented aiming state** -- handles targeting arc UI (this is used in the battle scene, not the simple harness) |\n\nThe **card_ui.tscn scene** instantiates all states as children of `CardStateMachine`, but the state machine logic and all state behaviors (except `card_aiming_state.gd`) are **not yet implemented** -- the stubs are empty. The `task_config.json` describes exactly what needs to be filled in for the card dragging mechanic to work.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f216c4a4bffeiX9lqaHGxJmSuM","sessionId":"ses_f216bb4d5ffe53fHIiHbhgs3AG","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore project structure","time":{"start":1790440655662,"end":1790441007332}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_6b221746-66fd-4bab-a7b1-f1717962bf82"}},"id":"prt_0de944b200012QaOaB8kUHH8wN","sessionID":"ses_f216c4a4bffeiX9lqaHGxJmSuM","messageID":"msg_0de93b82c001L51aVq093KAWrw"}}
